message: >-
  If you use the code or computational materials in this repository, please
  cite this software archive and the associated manuscript. A DOI will be
  added to this metadata after the versioned archive is deposited in Zenodo.
title: "CCPE Neural Roughness Index: Research Code and Computational Results"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-11-04
type: software
repository-code: "https://github.com/rkazemi76/CCPE_Neural_Roughness_Index"
authors:
  - family-names: Kazemi
    given-names: Reza
    affiliation: Department of Financial Mathematics, Allameh Tabataba'i University
  - family-names: Banihashemi
    given-names: Shokoofeh
