abstract: >-
  Research code, trained model artifacts, processed empirical inputs, and
  computational outputs supporting a simulation-calibrated neural roughness
  index for cryptocurrency volatility, including synthetic validation,
  exploratory empirical forecasting, smooth-semimartingale diagnostics, and
  CPU feature-generation benchmarks.
keywords:
  - rough volatility
  - cryptocurrency
  - neural estimation
  - realized volatility
  - reproducible research
  - computational finance
